As you walk and talk with <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ben</span>, you can’t help but notice that his body is slumped and he is dragging his feet, walking particularly slowly. You ask him and he’s alright and he quickly perks up. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Y- y- yeah! I’m fine! S- sorry!”</span> He blushes worriedly, gulping. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“S- sorry. It’s getting late, so I should really go. S- see you later!”</span> With that, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ben</span> quickly hurries off. <span style="color:LightCoral">You are a bit confused, though looking back on the day it is pretty clear that he wasn’t really enjoying himself much.</span> <br>
